<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential raises Avid.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential raises Avid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities analyst Alexander Henderson on Thursday said he raised Avid Technology to a buy rating from hold.</p>
<p>-- said upgraded company based upon better-than-expected 1997 second quarter earnings, revenues and gross margins and lower-than-expected selling, general and administrative expenses.</p>
<p>-- increased 1997 earnings estimate to $1.00 from $0.50.</p>
<p>-- increased 1998 earnings estimate to $1.45 from $1.00.</p>
<p>(( New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610))</p>
